{"unit_id":"YLingHao__dsh-codeui#feature-1","repo":"YLingHao/dsh-codeui","commit":"47b233a181f6f900c763ebb2b0af86a67cce956b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-codeui 的功能「每轮变更审阅」：读取会话中的 write、edit 和 str_replace_editor 操作，按轮次汇总受影响文件与增删行。轮次卡片和 Review 面板展示变更，用户可选择文件查看差异。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:580-645","lib/client.js:3410-3422"]}
{"unit_id":"YLingHao__dsh-codeui#feature-2","repo":"YLingHao/dsh-codeui","commit":"47b233a181f6f900c763ebb2b0af86a67cce956b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-codeui 的功能「差异与文件查看」：在 Review 面板中浏览所选轮次的文件内容，可切换统一、并排、改前、改后和当前视图，并查看工作区文件。通过面板控件选择文件和轮次。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:3232-3322","lib/index.js:252-287"]}
{"unit_id":"YLingHao__dsh-codeui#feature-3","repo":"YLingHao/dsh-codeui","commit":"47b233a181f6f900c763ebb2b0af86a67cce956b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-codeui 的功能「历史轮次跳转」：右侧常驻轨道展示会话轮次，点击轮次可将聊天滚动到对应提问，并同步审阅面板的轮次。悬停轮次可查看相关文件信息。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1410-1460","lib/client.js:3410-3417"]}
{"unit_id":"YLingHao__dsh-codeui#feature-4","repo":"YLingHao/dsh-codeui","commit":"47b233a181f6f900c763ebb2b0af86a67cce956b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-codeui 的功能「工作区文件编辑」：在 Review 面板切换到编辑模式，读取当前文件并保存修改。Host 检查文件是否属于当前工作区，并用文件版本令牌避免覆盖并发修改。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:288-318","lib/client.js:3240-3245"]}
{"unit_id":"YLingHao__dsh-codeui#caveat-1","repo":"YLingHao/dsh-codeui","commit":"47b233a181f6f900c763ebb2b0af86a67cce956b","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-codeui 的工作区浏览与编辑依赖 DSH 提供的 fs 服务和当前工作区；编辑请求会被限制在工作区内，并要求文件版本未变化。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:34-37","lib/index.js:288-318"]}
